    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": ". Velocity field of an incompressible fluid is given by –"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\n\\vec { V } = ( 6 x t + y z ^ { 2 } ) \\hat { e } _ { x } + ( 3 t + x y ^ { 2 } ) \\hat { e } _ { y } + ( x y - 2 x y z - 6 t z ) \\hat { e } _ { z }\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "i. What is the dimension of the flow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "ii. Is it a steady flow? Give reasons."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "iii. Show that $\\vec { \\nabla } \\cdot \\vec { V } = 0$ . What does this equation tell us about the flow physics?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "SECTION-B"
    }
